msgstr "श्यामश्वेत पाठ फाइलमा सेटिङ बचत गर्न सकिदैन ।"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_sharpen.cpp:56
msgid "Sharpening Photograph"
msgstr "फोटो तिखो पार्दैछ"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_sharpen.cpp:63
msgid "Sharpness:"
msgstr "तिखोपन:"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_sharpen.cpp:68
msgid ""
"<p>A sharpness of 0 has no effect, 1 and above determine the sharpen matrix "
"radius that determines how much to sharpen the image."
msgstr "<p>० तिखोपनले कुनै प्रभाव पार्दैन, १ र माथिले छवि कति तिखो पार्ने भनी निर्धारण गर्ने तिखोपन म्याक्ट्रिक्स रेडियस निर्धारण गर्दछ ।"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_sharpen.cpp:157
msgid "Sharpen"
msgstr "तोखो पार्नुहोस्"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_rgb.cpp:66 imageplugins/imageeffect_rgb.cpp:408
msgid "Color Balance"
msgstr "रङ सन्तुलन"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_rgb.cpp:72
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can see the image color-balance adjustments preview. You can "
"pick color on image to see the color level corresponding on histogram."
msgstr "<p>यहाँ तपाईँले रङ सन्तुलन समायोजन पूर्वावलोकन हेर्न सक्नुहुन्छ । तपाईँले हिस्टोग्राममा संगत रङ तह हेर्न छविमा रङ टिप्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_rgb.cpp:144
msgid "Cyan"
msgstr "क्यान"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_rgb.cpp:149
msgid "<p>Set here the cyan/red color adjustment of the image."
msgstr "<p>यहाँ छविको क्यान/रातो रङ समायोजन सेट गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_rgb.cpp:161
msgid "Magenta"
msgstr "म्याजेन्टा"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_rgb.cpp:166
msgid "<p>Set here the magenta/green color adjustment of the image."
msgstr "<p>यहाँ छविको म्याजेन्टा/हरियो रङ समायोजन सेट गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_rgb.cpp:178
msgid "Yellow"
msgstr "पहेलो"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_rgb.cpp:183
msgid "<p>Set here the yellow/blue color adjustment of the image."
msgstr "<p>छविको पहेलो/निलो रङ समायोजन सेट गर्नुहोस् ।"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_redeye.cpp:90
msgid "Red-Eye Correction Tool"
msgstr "रातो आँखा सुधार उपकरण"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_redeye.cpp:91
msgid ""
"You need to select a region including the eyes to use the red-eye correction "
"tool"
msgstr "तपाईँले रातो-आँखा सुधार उपकरण प्रयोग गर्न आँखा सहितको क्षेत्र चयन गर्नुपर्दछ"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_redeye.cpp:224
msgid "Red Eyes Correction"
msgstr "रातो आँखा सुधार"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_redeye.cpp:231
msgid "Red Eye Correction"
msgstr "रातो आँखा सुधार"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_redeye.cpp:237
msgid "Level of Red-Eye Correction"
msgstr "रातो-आँखा सुधारको तह"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_redeye.cpp:241
msgid "Mild (use if other parts of the face are also selected)"
msgstr "नरम (अनुहारको अन्य भाग पनि चयन गरेको छ भने प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्)"

#: imageplugins/imageeffect_redeye.cpp:243
msgid "Aggressive (use if eye(s) have been selected exactly)"
msgstr "उत्साही (यदि आँखा ठ्याक्कै चयन गरिएको छ भने प्रयोग गर्नुहोस्)"

